{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Still? ...ah, you noticed my disfigurement. Yes, fortunately I still retain use of my senses, even if not my speech.'","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:37:17.464000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863685364791508996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Then it might be some comfort to you, then. That is good to hear.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:38:02.850000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863685555154059294","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she shrugs, pulling her cloak tighter around her arms.","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:40:38.367000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863686207439110154","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"I'm Apgan, from Unit-119, by the way. I am fool enough to go wandering Empire City at night, but I'm not fool enough to challenge the curfew.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:43:45.800000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863686993590091806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"So hear I sit, with all my wanderlust, pent up in these immobile airships.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:44:07.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863687086385135677","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Lady Lovlatar, but you may call me Sabrine. I too am not willing to risk the curfew - the Redcoats already took everything I have, except my trusty guide Kukudh.'\nat this, the speaking raven raises a wing in greeting.","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:45:15.320000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863687369064579102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Roy is wandering the area, watching the airships he's passing by.","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:45:36.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863687458281357322","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Then it seems you would have precious little to risk, no? As long as you think you are capable of not getting caught.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:46:51.859000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863687773978099723","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Bo climbs down and greets everyone with a bow","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:47:55.920000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688042668752906","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Greetings. Come sit and dangle your legs above the thin fog below.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:48:23.057000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688156489187328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'I suppose, but... My life is fragile enough as it is.'","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:48:30.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688189486301224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Roy notices the group and walks over to them. \"Evenin'. Fellow airship-dwellers, I suppose?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:49:05.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688334786428939","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Such is my lot for the moment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:49:33.999000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688454042550272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Bo nods as he walks over. \"Howdy! The name's Bo, Cap'n Bo Harkness.\" He extends his hand.","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:49:38.825000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688474284654633","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she nods. 'The Nightingale is mine. Old and battered, like myself.'","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:50:20.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688649354248193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Apgan just nods, hands glued firmly to the ground as he peeks over the edge just a bit.","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:50:38.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688726289973248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she covers her mouth with one hand and lets out a small, strange laugh.","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:50:40.269000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688731998158848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Oh ho ho that is quite the thrill! The ground, she calls to me, cold and alluring as the grave.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:51:32.244000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863688949998026762","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'I- wouldn't call the grave alluring...'","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:52:33.589000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863689207297212426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she looks slightly paler.","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:52:44.143000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863689251564552193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Roy Gat. I'm staying in the Red Aphid over there. The one with that weird pigeon constantly flying circles around.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:52:57.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863689305934659584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"The Tatankan say that death appears to us a grim visage, but to the one whose time is come, there is nothing sweeter.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:53:46.905000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863689514806411274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"My time must indeed be short then, because every time I look below I'm tempted to feel the winds of destruction whip around my face in a blissful plummet.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:54:43.065000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863689750359048193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Bo points up to <#863492177924980737> \"that one's mine... Currently occupied by two pigeons fighting... One big and one red.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:54:46.577000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863689765089574912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'If I did not fear death, I would have succumbed to it long ago. Though perhaps taking some Redcoats with me.'","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:55:17.196000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863689893514838046","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Then I suppose your time is not yet come.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:55:33.342000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T07:55:40.578000Z","id":"863689961236594688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Given by the sound and smell, the Nightingale also has a pigeon resident. It doesn't bother me - I'm used to invisible birds.'\nKukudh raises a wing again.","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:56:19.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863690153424191508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Anyone know where i might find a banjo?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:56:32.064000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863690207534645279","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"The ferry market sells many things. I do not know banjos specifically.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:57:32.002000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863690458931527691","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Bo nods. \"Thank you kind sir!\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:58:32.784000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863690713870499840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Is that in Ferrytown?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:58:52.646000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863690797178290196","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"It is indeed.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T07:59:00.542000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863690830295597066","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Sounds like a place to check out, I suppose. After this pain of a curfew is over.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:00:30.011000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863691205555519488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Ah, no it occurs to me that I was thinking of the village.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:01:03.216000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863691344828170280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Which is in the city, but it only takes payment in silver.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:01:24.458000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863691433923706890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"she shrugs again. 'I would have to find some means of earning money before I took a visit to the market. The Redcoats took all I had when I arrived.'","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:01:50.654000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863691543796645898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"That's a bit of a pain. I'm all out of silver specifically.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:02:35.842000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T08:02:40.762000Z","id":"863691733329510410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Bo smirks at an idea he has. \"Which way you reckon for this village? Point in that general direction please.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:02:45.042000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863691771917369354","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"The city. You know, Manhattan.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:03:22.687000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863691929810894908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"And I would advise that regardless of what is in your purse, you keep to that story of no silver while here in hampstead.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:03:57.803000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863692077098074132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"\"Yeah, that's why I spent my silver first to be sure. Anywhere better than confiscated.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:04:55.202000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863692317848109086","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Bo smiles. \"Well I'm flat broke.\" He says while shrugging.","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:05:23.601000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863692436961361940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"'Why silver specifically? Are they perhaps werewolves who would rather it not be used against them?'","created_at":"2021-07-11T08:05:46.611000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863692533473345556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
